[SPEAKER_01]: Why is it like this?

22
00:02:20,879 --> 00:02:21,839
[SPEAKER_01]: Not in some other way?

23
00:02:22,419 --> 00:02:24,880
[SPEAKER_01]: Because if it weren't that way, it would have been some other way.

24
00:02:25,561 --> 00:02:34,404
[SPEAKER_01]: Because that lack of tameness, that wilderness of that mind, will find its ways of expressing itself.

25
00:02:34,424 --> 00:02:40,207
[SPEAKER_01]: The degree of how wild it is, how little regard it has for you.

26
00:02:41,068 --> 00:02:56,360
[SPEAKER_01]: So, the training of purification is the training of that animal and that in itself would then reduce the intensity of whatever that animal chooses to engage with, whatever the habits are, whether it's self-loathing or this or that.

27
00:02:57,841 --> 00:02:59,062
[SPEAKER_01]: It comes from the same place.

28
00:03:01,984 --> 00:03:03,666
[SPEAKER_00]: That the mind desires things.

29
00:03:04,366 --> 00:03:09,090
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, the mind desires things and if that desire has been kept, has been allowed,

30
