[SPEAKER_01]: To persist and proliferate unchecked, it will become pathological, in a way, the desire.

31
00:03:16,448 --> 00:03:20,671
[SPEAKER_01]: It will reach the extremes, that it's now just unbearable.

32
00:03:21,391 --> 00:03:26,475
[SPEAKER_01]: But the only reason is, that is such, is because the mind has been allowed to sort of

